          "images": [
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Original marketing: three separate trunks and lobed crowns visible on green raised ground. Finger-like blunt roots sit prominently on surface; deep repeated body furrows read as scored wood/cuts. Brass clasp, corner caps, side ring and round disc visible; stone feet retained.",
