            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Desktop closed: three ornamental trees readable and all silhouettes fit. Lid top shifts pale sage in lighting; bark relief has repetitive abrupt ends and stronger front texture. No obvious missing tree or major mesh failure.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/sierra-leone/desktop-closed.png"
            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Desktop open: grove hidden behind raised lid, green inner lid and empty cavity visible. Rear gap and small hinge connections can make lid look suspended; full silhouette fits. Floor partly obscured, not proven absent.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/sierra-leone/desktop-open.png"
            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Mobile closed: three trunks readable, neighboring crowns partially merge. Roots angular and tiny, brass relatively flat at this scale; model/title/controls fit.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/sierra-leone/mobile-closed.png"
            },
            {
              "inspected": true,
              "observations": "Mobile open: full raised lid, isolated-looking upper latch tab, body and feet fit. Cavity readable; fine hinge/contact geometry cannot be determined from static capture.",
              "path": "parent/smoke/sierra-leone/mobile-open.png"
            }
          ],
          "limitations": [
            "Lobed ornamental trees rather than dense rainforest; crown overlap and blunt roots.",
            "Deep scored-wood body, uneven front/side relief and pale-lit green lid; open projection hides grove."
